# The image runs `app/` over `sdg1531/` and nothing else. Everything below is
# either a build artefact, a dev-only tool, or the legacy Voila implementation
# that only the parity harness (CI) needs -- `tests/golden/` alone is ~3 MB of
# serialized Earth Engine graphs.
